    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43883" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔζωρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>quite pure, unmixed</i>,
			of wine, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				3.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
			</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				757
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				227
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ότερος</span>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, εὐζωρότερον . . , ὦ παῖ, δός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diph.
					58
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				412
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				382
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέρασον εὐζωρέστερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					139
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίνειν . . κύλικας εὐζωρεστέρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eub.
					150.8
				</span></i>
			 ( =
			<i><span class="en">
				Ephipp.
				3.11
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lyr.Adesp.</u>
				p.681
			</span></i> Bgk.</div>
